+   ```
+
+3. **下游回归验证**（Piecewise / boolalg 相关）：
+   ```bash
+   python -m pytest sympy/functions/elementary/tests/test_piecewise.py -v
+   python -m pytest sympy/logic/tests/test_boolalg.py -v
+   python -m pytest sympy/sets/tests/test_sets.py -v
+   ```
+   预期：全部通过，无新增失败（这些文件本身不做代码修改，仅验证 `Contains.as_set` 契约变更未引入回归）。
+
+4. **全量 sets + logic 测试套件**（收尾确认）：
+   ```bash
+   python -m pytest sympy/sets/ sympy/logic/ sympy/functions/elementary/tests/test_piecewise.py sympy/solvers/tests/test_solveset.py -q
+   ```
+
